Eastern Championship Wrestling was founded in 1992 by local Phildadelphia businessman Tod Gordon. The promotion takes cues from the original Tri-State Wrestling and features many of that promotion's alumni. ECW puts on a slightly more "hardcore" version of wrestling than what you might find in the more tradtional promotions in the United States.
